            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Dinner at Cim's",
            "review_text": "Thejefe413\n5 contributions\n0\nExcellence through and through\nJun 2021 • Friends\nDinner at Cim’s is a wonderful hideaway of a restaurant, tucked neatly away from the hustle of the main streets of Nha Trang. \nThe owner/chef knows his business in both the kitchen and the front of the house, quite literally as the restaurant is set within a home. His staff (family) were very attentive as well as knowledgeable regarding the menus; food and cocktails/wine. \nOur dinner experience was excellent overall, with fresh, well plated entrees and a delicious homemade pie for dessert. \nI would recommend this restaurant to anyone who finds themselves in need of a great meal and cozy atmosphere while visiting Nha Trang.\nRead more\nWritten June 22, 2021",
